   "or a folder of them. JPG, PNG, WebP, GIF, BMP and TIFF all work.": "या उनका फ़ोल्डर। JPG, PNG, WebP, GIF, BMP और TIFF सब चलते हैं।",
   "Put them in order": "क्रम में लगाएँ",
